#TODO: Update the unit test with new Scenario
Feature: RBAC Permission Checking

  Background:
    Given the HMG Role Admin has the following API key: '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c576c5'
    * a Project with the following attributes exists
      """json
      {
         "key": "hmg-notice",
         "name": "HMG Notice"
      }
      """
    And a Member with specific attributes exists
      """json
        {
           "key": "alice_ignite1",
           "name": "alice",
           "apiKey": "22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57821",
           "type": "PROJECT_ADMIN"
        }
      """
    * a Resource Type for API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57821' with specific attributes exists
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ",
         "name": "FAQ",
         "description": "FAQ",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ]
      }
      """
    * a Resource Type for API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57821' with specific attributes exists
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ-2",
         "name": "FAQ-2",
         "description": "FAQ-2",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ],
         "tags": [
            "tag1",
            "tag2"
         ]
      }
      """
    * a Role for API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57821' with specific attributes exists
      """json
      {
         "name": "ADMIN-NOTICE",
         "key": "role-key-permission-test",
         "description": "Role for the Administrator"
      }
      """
    * a User for API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57821' with specific attributes exists
      """json
        {
           "key": "john@hmg-notice",
           "name": "John Doe",
           "roles": [
              "ADMIN-NOTICE"
           ]
        }
      """
    * a Policy for API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57821' with specific attributes exists
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ_ADMIN_POLICY",
         "description": "FAQ resource policy for Admin",
         "resourceType": "FAQ",
         "scope": "",
         "actions": [
            "update",
            "create"
         ],
         "roles": [
            "role-key-permission-test"
         ],
         "effect": "ALLOW"
      }
      """
    * a Policy for API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57821' with specific attributes exists
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ_ADMIN_POLICY_2",
         "description": "FAQ resource policy for Admin",
         "resourceType": "FAQ-2",
         "actions": [
            "update",
            "create"
         ],
         "roles": [
            "role-key-permission-test"
         ],
         "effect": "ALLOW"
      }
      """

  Scenario: Positive: Extended RBAC Permission Checking with case: User-Role DB provided, Payload user.id provided, Payload roles provided
    Given the Resource Server wants to check permissions with the following attributes:
      """json
      {
         "user": {
            "key": "john@hmg-notice",
            "roles": [
               "role-key-permission-test"
            ],
            "scope": ""
         },
         "resources": [
            {
               "resource": {
                  "id": "CCI-FAQ-1",
                  "type": "FAQ",
                  "scope": ""
               },
               "actions": [
                  "update",
                  "create"
               ]
            }
         ]
      }
      """
    When the Resource Server checks permissions with flattenResponseFormat is 'false'
    Then the permission check is successful with response code 200
    And the response body contains the following attributes:
      """json
      {
         "results": [
            {
               "resource": {
                  "id": "CCI-FAQ-1",
                  "type": "FAQ",
                  "scope": ""
               },
               "actionEffects": [
                  {
                     "action": "update",
                     "role": "role-key-permission-test",
                     "effect": "ALLOW"
                  },
                  {
                     "action": "create",
                     "role": "role-key-permission-test",
                     "effect": "ALLOW"
                  }
               ]
            }
         ]
      }
      """

